- Two pieces of content need tightening before the remaining 16 guides:
  - "by income" entries should say how each study bears on the indicator;
  - consider an `outcome` field on policy entries, so a direction badge isn't read as an effect on this indicator.
- Price level is computed in the site; it could move to the pipeline.
- The reading-studies page names specific GDP-guide entries in prose; add a test that they still exist.
- Earlier minors:
  - the ICP guard fails open;
  - tied percentiles;
  - an empty category filter gives no error;
  - DEU shows as a bare code;
  - missing citation pages;
  - the break-parity assumption;
  - an Argentina FCRF caveat;
  - pydantic errors don't name the file;
  - duplicate changelog date headings.

